<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-044" chapter-id="c-jinshu-044-jin067-wenqiao" source-id="s-jinshu-044-jin067-wenqiao">
  <p id="c-jinshu-044-jin067-wenqiao:family" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-044-jin067-wenqiao:family:m0000" ref="1ec_i30_u8n_A">溫羨</persName>，字<persName id="c-jinshu-044-jin067-wenqiao:family:m0004" ref="1ec_i30_u8n_A">長卿</persName>，太原祁人，漢護羌校尉序之後也。祖<persName id="c-jinshu-044-jin067-wenqiao:family:m0023" ref="8uz_r1g_a0f_A">恢</persName>，魏揚州刺史。父<persName id="c-jinshu-044-jin067-wenqiao:family:m0032" ref="1ec_i30_u8n">恭</persName>，濟南太守。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-044-jin067-wenqiao:yuan" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">有三子：祗、<persName id="c-jinshu-044-jin067-wenqiao:yuan:m0006" ref="1ec_i30_u8n_AA">允</persName>、裕。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-044-jin067-wenqiao:yun" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-044-jin067-wenqiao:yun:m0000" ref="1ec_i30_u8n_AA">允</persName>字<persName id="c-jinshu-044-jin067-wenqiao:yun:m0002" ref="1ec_i30_u8n_AA">敬咸</persName>，太子舍人。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-044-jin067-wenqiao:luchen" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-044-jin067-wenqiao:luchen:m0000" ref="b21_e55_8bd">琨</persName>妻即<persName id="c-jinshu-044-jin067-wenqiao:luchen:m0003" ref="m8n_ntm_79h_ABBA">諶</persName>之從母，既加親愛，又重其才地。</p>
</text>
